* Make the game refill shop. For example by using a restock machine.
* Go to the regular underground shop in the normal non-mirror world.
* Now the underground shop contains two overlapped sets of things on sale : One from when the mirror version was restocked, and one from when you entered the "real" underground shop for the first time.}}
{{bug|If Isaac teleports to an {{r|I AM ERROR}}, {{r|Devil Room}}, or {{r|Angel Room}} from the underground Shop, and then enters a {{r|Crawl Space}} from that room, exiting the Crawl Space will lead Isaac to the underground Shop. From there, Isaac is unable to exit the underground Shop, and he will be permanently stuck unless he can teleport out.}}

